# Hassan's Portfolio Environment Variables

# Contact Destination Email
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=hassan.ashraf12@gmail.com

# Web3Forms API Access Key (Free form submission API - get your key at https://web3forms.com)
# Register with your deployed Vercel domain and hassan.ashraf12@gmail.com
